#: 908M10
msgid "Yes."
msgstr "Ja."

#: 908M10A
msgid "We can forget all about that troubled world down there."
msgstr "Vi kan glömma allt om den oroliga världen där nere."

#: 908M10B
msgid "All the danger is behind us now."
msgstr "All fara ligger bakom oss nu."

#: 908R01
msgid "Just the same, Mei Chen."
msgstr "Just det, Mei Chen."

#: 908R01A
msgid "It's true."
msgstr "Det är sant."

#: 908R01B
msgid "I'm lucky I made it out of Egypt."
msgstr "Jag hade tur som kom ut ur Egypten."

#: 908R02
msgid "Not my autograph, old wager."
msgstr "Inte min autograf, gamle baron."

#: 908R03
msgid "We both take pleasure where we find it, May."
msgstr "Vi finner båda glädje där vi kan, May."

#: 908R03A
msgid "That's why we're so well suited to each other."
msgstr "Det är därför vi passar så bra ihop."

#: 908R04
msgid "I couldn't have done it without you, May."
msgstr "Jag hade inte klarat det utan dig, May."

#: 908R05
msgid "I don't know what you mean."
msgstr "Jag vet inte vad du menar."

#: 908R05A
msgid "Is she safe?"
msgstr "Är hon i säkerhet?"

#: 908R06
msgid "Well, I didn't think it would hurt to make inquiries."
msgstr "Nå, jag trodde inte att det kunde skada att göra efterforskningar."

#: 908R07
msgid "Ah..."
msgstr "Ah …"

#: 908R07A
msgid "What?"
msgstr "Vad?"

#: 908R07B
msgid "Gosh."
msgstr "Jösses."

#: 908R07C
msgid "It sure will be nice to be back in New York, won't it?"
msgstr "Det ska bli skönt att komma tillbaka till New York, eller hur?"

#: 908W01
msgid "But why?"
msgstr "Men varför?"

#: 909M01
msgid "Forget about those bad men."
msgstr "Glöm de där onda männen."

#: 910M01
msgid "They are far behind you now."
msgstr "De är långt bakom dig nu."

#: 911K01
msgid "The notes from his satchel were useless."
msgstr "Anteckningarna från hans väska var värdelösa."

#: 911S01
msgid "What did the radiogram say?"
msgstr "Vad stod det i radiogrammet?"

#: 912K01
msgid "We are not to kill him until we have the key."
msgstr "Vi får inte döda honom förrän vi har nyckeln."

#: 912S01
msgid "May we find it soon."
msgstr "Må vi snart finna den."

#: 950_T10
msgid "Give me your spleen!"
msgstr "Ge mig din mjälte!"

#: 950_T11
msgid "BOOM!"
msgstr "BOM!"

#: 950_T12
msgid "Cough, cough, cough, cough, cough, cough."
msgstr "Host, host, host, host, host, host."

#: COM001
msgid "All Posh Express offices look pretty much the same."
msgstr "Alla Posh Express-kontor ser i stort sett likadana ut."

#: COM002
msgid ""
"From Auckland to Zanzibar, there's always a posh express office when you "
"need it."
msgstr ""
"Från Auckland till Zanzibar finns det alltid ett Posh Express-kontor när man"
" behöver det."

#: COM003
msgid "No time for reading."
msgstr "Ingen tid för läsning."

#: COM004
msgid "Ripley, you don't need a postcard."
msgstr "Ripley, du behöver inget vykort."

#: COM005
msgid "I don't really need four-year-old copies of Posh Traveler."
msgstr "Jag behöver egentligen inte fyra år gamla exemplar av Posh Traveler."

#: COM006
msgid "Ripley, get a grip on yourself."
msgstr "Ripley, skärp dig."

#: COM007
msgid "You don't need that."
msgstr "Du behöver inte den där."

#: COM008
msgid "This is no time to play the fool."
msgstr "Det här är ingen tid att spela dum."

#: COM009
msgid "There's no time."
msgstr "Det finns ingen tid."

#: COM010
msgid "I'm not thinking."
msgstr "Jag tänker inte."

#: COM011
msgid "That will work."
msgstr "Det fungerar."

#: COM012
msgid ""
"I can't be too free with my limited funds. I'll undoubtedly need every penny"
" before all this is over."
msgstr ""
"Jag kan inte vara alltför frikostig med mina begränsade medel. Jag kommer "
"utan tvekan att behöva varenda öre innan det här är över."

#: COM013
msgid "You can't do that."
msgstr "Du kan inte göra det."

#: COM014
msgid "Nothing of interest to sketch in here."
msgstr "Inget av intresse att skissa här inne."

#: COM015
msgid ""
"Ace of Spades Castle will make a marvelous addition to my gallery of "
"cartoons."
msgstr ""
"Spader ess-slottet blir ett utmärkt tillskott till mitt galleri av "
"teckningar."

#: COM016
msgid "I already have a sketch of this amazing castle."
msgstr "Jag har redan en skiss av det här fantastiska slottet."

#: COM017
msgid "I'd better hang on to that for now."
msgstr "Bäst att behålla den här tills vidare."

#: COM018
msgid "That isn't gonna work."
msgstr "Det där fungerar inte."

#: COM019
msgid "I thought for sure that might work, but it won't."
msgstr "Jag var säker på att det kanske skulle fungera, men det gör det inte."

#: COM020
msgid "That doesn't seem to work."
msgstr "Det där verkar inte fungera."

#: COM021
msgid "You'd think that would work, but it doesn't."
msgstr "Man skulle kunna tro att det skulle fungera, men det gör det inte."

#: COM022
msgid "Lamps like that were made for decoration, not illumination."
msgstr "Sådana lampor gjordes för dekoration, inte för belysning."

#: COM023
msgid "It certainly makes a statement, but I wouldn't want to sit on it."
msgstr ""
"Den gör onekligen ett intryck, men jag skulle inte vilja sitta på den."
